<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS- DePuy flat, Education shines.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS- DePuy flat, Education shines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Education Management shares rose on their first day of trading on Thursday, but the market gave a lukewarm or chilly reception to other companies making their market debuts.</p>
<p>-- Education Management Corp shares rose 1-3/8 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Shares of DePuy Inc which makes orthopedic devices,  closed flat at 17-1/2 in heavy trading. The company offered almost 15 million shares for $17.50 each.</p>
<p>-- Boston Biomedica Inc shares fell 3/4 to 7-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Donnelley Enterprises Solutions Inc shares were flat at $25 after the company's initial public offering.</p>
</text>
